{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/20505","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:02.868013+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"```\n/home/muzasyed/projects/project3/samples/mlir/onnx_failure.mlir:1:1: error: found an unresolved external function 'malloc' in the final bitcode. A remaining live user is\n  %5 = tail call dereferenceable_or_null(24) ptr @malloc(i64 24)\nmodule {\n```\nmalloc shouldn't ever happen...\n```\n%alloc = memref.alloc() : memref<6xf32, #amdgpu.address_space<fat_raw_buffer>>\n```\nI'm not sure how this happened but allocating global memory inside the kernel is a big no-no. The bufferization configuration for TileAndFuse should be blocking against this but perhaps there is an allocation path I'm not aware of. Figuring out where this allocation comes from and making sure we allocate `workgroup` or `private` memory (depending on how it's used) should fix the issue.\n\n","created_at":"2025-04-08T22:01:21Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/20505#issuecomment-2787756974","id":2787756974,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/20505","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M6mKcuu","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":1,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2787756974/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-04-08T22:01:21Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2787756974","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22101546?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/qedawkins","id":22101546,"login":"qedawkins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTAxNTQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Ah that makes sense, thanks Quinn!","created_at":"2025-04-08T22:03:30Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/20505#issuecomment-2787759967","id":2787759967,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/20505","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M6mKddf","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2787759967/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-04-08T22:03:30Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/2787759967","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55665739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE","id":55665739,"login":"Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NjY1NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### What happened?\n\nBackground: [#20411](https://github.com/iree-org/iree/pull/20411)\n\nAfter changing the KernelConfig to lower LinalgExt::SortOp through the LLVMGPUTileAndFuse pipeline (instead of LLVMGPUDistribute) we encounter a failure with the following ONNX test in CI: [Failing test.](https://github.com/iree-org/iree/actions/runs/14319065893/job/40132245895?pr=20411#step:8:61) \nThis failure does not affect the LLVMGPUDistribute pipeline, and I would appreciate help in figuring out why.\n\n**Failing test**\n```\nmodule {\n  func.func @test_nonmaxsuppression_center_point_box_format(%arg0: !torch.vtensor<[1,6,4],f32>, %arg1: !torch.vtensor<[1,1,6],f32>, %arg2: !torch.vtensor<[1],si64>, %arg3: !torch.vtensor<[1],f32>, %arg4: !torch.vtensor<[1],f32>) -> !torch.vtensor<[3,3],si64> attributes {torch.onnx_meta.ir_version = 6 : si64, torch.onnx_meta.opset_version = 17 : si64, torch.onnx_meta.producer_name = \"backend-test\", torch.onnx_meta.producer_version = \"\"} {\n    %none = torch.constant.none\n    %0 = torch.operator \"onnx.NonMaxSuppression\"(%arg0, %arg1, %arg2, %arg3, %arg4) {torch.onnx.center_point_box = 1 : si64} : (!torch.vtensor<[1,6,4],f32>, !torch.vtensor<[1,1,6],f32>, !torch.vtensor<[1],si64>, !torch.vtensor<[1],f32>, !torch.vtensor<[1],f32>) -> !torch.vtensor<[3,3],si64> \n    return %0 : !torch.vtensor<[3,3],si64>\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Command**\n```\niree-compile <input.mlir> --iree-hal-target-device=hip --iree-hip-target=gfx1100 --iree-input-demote-f64-to-f32=false \n```\n\n**Error**\n[Full error here](https://gist.github.com/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/7bda8e040b2ab497f38c5141f7dc1ba2#file-failure-txt)\n```\n/home/muzasyed/projects/project3/samples/mlir/onnx_failure.mlir:1:1: error: found an unresolved external function 'malloc' in the final bitcode. A remaining live user is\n  %5 = tail call dereferenceable_or_null(24) ptr @malloc(i64 24)\nmodule {\n^\n```\n\nThe smallest significant difference I've found between the two pipelines is after the `IREEComprehensiveBufferizePass`\n\nLLVMGPUTileAndFuse: [see gist for complete IR](https://gist.github.com/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/d2bdb40af926382674fb0d8cf9c576bf#file-ireecomprehensivebufferizepass-txt)\nLLVMGPUDistribute: [see gist for complete IR](https://gist.github.com/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/e8124e1a033aa8083918c8b7d729e493#file-ireecomprehensivebufferizepass-txt)\n\nSpecifically, this alloc:\n**LLVMGPUTileAndFuse**\n```\nfunc.func @test_nonmaxsuppression_center_point_box_format$async_dispatch_6_sort_6xf32_dispatch_tensor_store() attributes {translation_info = #iree_codegen.translation_info<pipeline = LLVMGPUTileAndFuse workgroup_size = [1, 1, 1] subgroup_size = 32>} {\n  ...\n  %alloc = memref.alloc() : memref<6xf32, #amdgpu.address_space<fat_raw_buffer>>\n  ...\n  iree_linalg_ext.sort {lowering_config = #iree_gpu.lowering_config<{thread = [0], workgroup = [0]}>} dimension(0) outs(%alloc, %3 : memref<6xf32, #amdgpu.address_space<fat_raw_buffer>>, memref<6xi64, strided<[1]>, #amdgpu.address_space<fat_raw_buffer>>) {\n   ...\n  return\n}\n```\n**LLVMGPUDistribute**\n```\nfunc.func @test_nonmaxsuppression_center_point_box_format$async_dispatch_6_sort_6xf32_dispatch_tensor_store() attributes {translation_info = #iree_codegen.translation_info<pipeline = LLVMGPUDistribute workgroup_size = [1, 1, 1]>} {\n  ...\n  %alloc = memref.alloc() : memref<6xf32, #gpu.address_space<workgroup>>\n  gpu.barrier\n  ...\n  iree_linalg_ext.sort {lowering_config = #iree_codegen.lowering_config<tile_sizes = [[]]>} dimension(0) outs(%alloc, %3 : memref<6xf32, #gpu.address_space<workgroup>>, memref<6xi64, strided<[1]>, #amdgpu.address_space<fat_raw_buffer>>) {\n  ...\n  return\n}\n```","closed_at":"2025-04-11T18:29:12Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55665739?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE","id":55665739,"login":"Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1NjY1NzM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muzammiluddin-Syed-ECE","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/20505/comments","created_at":"2025-04-08T21:32:36Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/20505/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/20505","id":2980998960,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1553038945,"name":"bug 🐞","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUzMDM4OTQ1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/bug%20%F0%9F%90%9E"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/20505/l