med_via_github_app":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/events/17178246639"},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22101546?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/qedawkins","id":22101546,"login":"qedawkins","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTAxNTQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qedawkins","user_view_type":"public"},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"```\n/home/muzasyed/projects/project3/samples/mlir/onnx_failure.mlir:1:1: error: found an unresolved external function 'malloc' in the final bitcode. A remaining live user is\n  %5 = tail call dereferenceable_or_null(24) ptr @malloc(i64 24)\nmodule {\n```\nmalloc shouldn't ever happen...\n```\n%alloc = memref.alloc() : memref<6xf32, #amdgpu.address_space<fat_raw_buffer>>\n```\nI'm not sure how this happened but allocating global memory inside the kernel is a big no-no. The bufferization configuration for TileAndFuse should be blocking against this but perhaps there is an allocation path I'm not aware of. Figuring out where this allocation comes from and making sure we allocate `workgroup` or `private` memory (depending on how it's used) should fix the issue.\n\n","created_at":"2025-04-08T22:01:21Z","event":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/20505#issuecommen